{"sections":[{"slug":"法丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"法丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"(<span lang=\"zh\">余</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">法丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"(余) 法丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">余法丛</span></h3>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> 1</h4>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/理想层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">理想层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义的子概形</span> $Z$, <span lang=\"zh\">余法丛定义为</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拉回</span>.</p>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> 2</h4>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Y\\subset X$, <span lang=\"zh\">余法丛</span> $N_{Y/X}^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余切丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的态射</span> $\\Omega_X\\big|_Y \\to \\Omega_Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的核</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑由</span> $d$ <span lang=\"zh\">次齐次多项式</span> $\\sigma\\in\\Gamma(\\mathbb P^n,\\mathcal O_{\\mathbb P^n}(d))$ <span lang=\"zh\">的零点确定的代数簇</span> $X\\subset \\mathbb P^n$. $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的法丛与余法丛分别同构于</span> $\\mathcal O_{\\mathbb P^n}(d),\\mathcal O_{\\mathbb P^n}(-d)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">直观上的解释</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">法丛的截面是</span> $\\sigma$ <span lang=\"zh\">的小扰动</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">向量空间中一点的切空间仍是该向量空间</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>, $\\mathbb P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/典范丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">典范丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制等于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的典范丛与余法丛的张量积</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关话题</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/(余)切丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}